---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How long does an SEO audit take?',
    a: 'A full SEO audit takes 7 to 10 working days from receiving access to your Google Search Console, Google Analytics, and website backend. The 30-minute walkthrough call is scheduled within 5 working days of the report being delivered.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What access do you need to run the audit?',
    a: 'We need read-only access to Google Search Console, Google Analytics 4, and ideally your CMS backend. We also review your Google Business Profile listing. All access can be granted via email invitation without sharing passwords.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is the difference between your paid audit and the free audit?',
    a: 'The free audit is an automated quick health check covering indexation, mobile usability, Core Web Vitals, and three quick wins. The paid audit is a manual, comprehensive analysis covering technical SEO, content quality, backlink profile, local SEO, and competitor benchmarking, delivered as a detailed PDF with a priority action plan and a personal walkthrough call.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Will the audit fix my SEO problems?',
    a: 'The audit identifies problems and prioritises them by impact. It includes a clear action plan you can implement yourself or hand to your developer. If you want us to implement the fixes, we offer ongoing SEO retainers starting from £750 per month.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does an SEO audit cost in Birmingham?',
    a: 'Our one-off SEO audit is priced at £497. This includes the full technical, content, backlink, and local SEO analysis, a detailed PDF report, a priority action plan, and a 30-minute video walkthrough call. There are no hidden costs or ongoing commitments.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I use the audit to brief another SEO agency?',
    a: 'Absolutely. The audit report is yours to use however you choose. Many Birmingham businesses use it to brief their in-house team or compare recommendations from other agencies. The report is designed to be clear and actionable regardless of who implements it.',
  },
];

const serviceSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'SEO Audit Birmingham',
  description: 'Comprehensive SEO audit for Birmingham businesses covering technical SEO, content analysis, backlink profile, local SEO, and competitor benchmarking.',
  provider: {
    '@type': 'LocalBusiness',
    name: 'SEO Birmingham',
    url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk',
    areaServed: {
      '@type': 'City',
      name: 'Birmingham',
      containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
    },
  },
  serviceType: 'SEO Audit',
  areaServed: {
    '@type': 'City',
    name: 'Birmingham',
    containedInPlace: { '@type': 'AdministrativeArea', name: 'West Midlands' },
  },
  offers: {
    '@type': 'Offer',
    price: '497',
    priceCurrency: 'GBP',
    availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock',
    priceValidUntil: '2026-12-31',
    description: 'One-off comprehensive SEO audit including PDF report, action plan, and 30-minute walkthrough call',
  },
};

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a },
  })),
};
---

<Base
  title="SEO Audit Birmingham | Full Site Audit"
  description="Full SEO audit for Birmingham businesses. Technical, content, backlink, and local SEO analysis with a prioritised action plan and walkthrough. From £497."
  schema={[serviceSchema, faqSchema]}
  ogType="website"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>SEO Audit Birmingham</h1>

    <p>An SEO audit is a systematic examination of every factor that influences your website's search engine visibility. For Birmingham businesses operating in competitive local markets, a professional audit reveals exactly why your site is not ranking where it should and provides a prioritised roadmap to fix it.</p>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>Quick Answer:</strong> Our Birmingham SEO audit covers technical health, content quality, backlink profile, local SEO, and competitor analysis. You receive a detailed PDF report, a priority action plan ranked by impact, and a 30-minute video walkthrough call. One-off price: <strong>£497</strong>. <a href="/contact/">Book yours today</a>.
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>What Is Included in the Audit</h2>

      <p>Every audit follows the same rigorous methodology, applied to your specific Birmingham business context. We do not use automated reports alone. Each section is manually reviewed and annotated with specific recommendations.</p>

      <h3>Technical SEO Analysis</h3>
      <p>We crawl your entire site to identify indexation issues, broken links, redirect chains, duplicate content, slow page speeds, Core Web Vitals failures, mobile usability problems, and structured data errors. This mirrors the checks covered in our dedicated <a href="/technical-seo-birmingham/">technical SEO service</a>, but within the broader audit context.</p>

      <h3>Content Quality Assessment</h3>
      <p>We evaluate every indexable page for keyword targeting, content depth, heading structure, internal linking, and topical relevance. Thin content, cannibalisation (where multiple pages compete for the same keyword), and content gaps relative to your Birmingham competitors are all flagged.</p>

      <h3>Backlink Profile Review</h3>
      <p>Using Ahrefs data, we assess your domain authority, referring domain quality, anchor text distribution, and toxic link risk. We compare your backlink profile against the top-ranking Birmingham competitors for your target keywords to identify link-building opportunities.</p>

      <h3>Local SEO Assessment</h3>
      <p>For Birmingham businesses, local SEO is often the highest-impact area. We audit your Google Business Profile completeness, NAP (Name, Address, Phone) consistency across directories, local citation presence, review profile, and local pack eligibility for your target queries.</p>

      <h3>Competitor Benchmarking</h3>
      <p>We identify your top 5 organic competitors in Birmingham and analyse what they are doing differently. This covers their content strategy, technical setup, backlink sources, and local SEO presence. You receive specific, actionable insights on where you can overtake them.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How the Audit Process Works</h2>

      <p>The audit follows a structured five-step process from initial setup to final delivery.</p>

      <ol>
        <li><strong>Access and setup.</strong> You grant us read-only access to Google Search Console and Google Analytics 4. We configure our crawling tools and begin data collection. This takes one working day.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical crawl and data gathering.</strong> We run a full site crawl, pull 16 months of search performance data, export your backlink profile, and audit your Google Business Profile. This runs in parallel over 2 to 3 days.</li>
        <li><strong>Manual analysis and annotation.</strong> Our SEO consultant manually reviews every data point, cross-references findings, and writes specific recommendations for your business. No generic advice: every recommendation references your actual pages, keywords, and Birmingham competitors. This takes 3 to 5 working days.</li>
        <li><strong>Report compilation.</strong> Findings are compiled into a structured PDF report with an executive summary, detailed section breakdowns, and a priority action plan ranked by estimated impact and implementation difficulty.</li>
        <li><strong>Walkthrough call.</strong> We schedule a 30-minute video call to walk you through the key findings, answer questions, and discuss implementation priorities. This call is recorded so you can share it with your team or developer.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What You Receive</h2>

      <p>The audit deliverables are designed to be immediately actionable, whether you implement changes yourself, brief your developer, or engage us for ongoing SEO.</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>PDF audit report</strong> (typically 30 to 50 pages) covering all five audit areas with screenshots, data tables, and specific recommendations</li>
        <li><strong>Priority action plan</strong> as a standalone spreadsheet, ranked by impact (high/medium/low) and effort (quick fix/medium/complex), so you know exactly where to start</li>
        <li><strong>30-minute video walkthrough call</strong> with our SEO consultant, recorded for your reference</li>
        <li><strong>Raw data exports</strong> including crawl data, keyword rankings, and backlink profile for your records</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who Needs an SEO Audit</h2>

      <p>An audit is valuable at specific inflection points in your business lifecycle. The following situations signal that an SEO audit will deliver a strong return on investment.</p>

      <h3>New Businesses Launching in Birmingham</h3>
      <p>If you are launching a new website for a Birmingham business, an audit of your staging site before go-live prevents costly mistakes. We catch indexation blockers, missing redirects from an old domain, and local SEO setup gaps before they affect your rankings.</p>

      <h3>Businesses Losing Organic Traffic</h3>
      <p>Traffic drops after Google algorithm updates are a clear signal that something needs fixing. An audit pinpoints whether the cause is technical (site speed, crawl errors), content-related (thin pages, cannibalisation), or penalty-related (toxic backlinks, manual actions).</p>

      <h3>Website Redesign or Platform Migration</h3>
      <p>Migrating from one CMS to another or redesigning your site is the single most dangerous moment for SEO. A pre-migration audit ensures redirect maps are complete and no ranking equity is lost. A post-migration audit catches anything that slipped through.</p>

      <h3>Not Appearing in Birmingham's Local Pack</h3>
      <p>If your Birmingham competitors appear in Google's local 3-pack and you do not, an audit will identify the specific local ranking factors holding you back. Common causes include inconsistent NAP data, thin Google Business Profile content, and missing local schema markup.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Birmingham-Specific Audit Considerations</h2>

      <p>Every city has a unique competitive landscape, and Birmingham is no exception. Our audits account for factors specific to the West Midlands market.</p>

      <h3>Colmore Business District Professional Services</h3>
      <p>Law firms, accountancies, and consultancies in the Colmore district compete fiercely for high-value keywords. We benchmark your site against the top-ranking Colmore competitors, analysing their content depth, schema usage, and local citation profiles to find gaps you can exploit.</p>

      <h3>Jewellery Quarter Retail and E-Commerce</h3>
      <p>Jewellery Quarter businesses often have product-heavy sites with complex filtering and pagination. Our audit identifies crawl budget waste, product schema opportunities, and image optimisation gaps that are costing you visibility against national jewellery retailers.</p>

      <h3>NEC and Event-Based Businesses</h3>
      <p>Businesses serving the NEC, ICC, and Birmingham's conference circuit rely on seasonal search demand. An audit of these sites focuses on event schema, landing page freshness, and ensuring historical event pages are properly archived rather than returning 404 errors.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Pricing</h2>

      <p>The one-off SEO audit is priced at <strong>£497</strong> inclusive of all deliverables listed above. There is no ongoing commitment or hidden subscription.</p>

      <p>If you decide to proceed with implementation, the audit cost is credited against your first month of any ongoing SEO retainer. View our full <a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO pricing</a> for retainer options.</p>

      <p>Want a quick snapshot before committing? Try our <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">free SEO audit</a> for an automated health check first.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 style="color: white; margin-top: 0;">Book Your Birmingham SEO Audit</h2>
      <p>Find out exactly what is holding your site back with a comprehensive, manually reviewed SEO audit.</p>
      <a href="/contact/">Get Started — £497</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.q}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.a}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Related Services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">SEO Birmingham</a> — full SEO services overview</li>
        <li><a href="/services/">All SEO Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/technical-seo-birmingham/">Technical SEO Birmingham</a></li>
        <li><a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">Free SEO Audit Birmingham</a> — quick automated check</li>
        <li><a href="/seo-pricing-birmingham/">SEO Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
